// Cuando VITE_USE_MOCK es igual a "true", createAdapter devuelve LocalStorageApiClient sin realizar llamadas de red.
STORAGE-ADAPTER-001 WHEN VITE_USE_MOCK is set to "true" THEN createAdapter shall return an instance of LocalStorageApiClient without performing a network health check.

// Cuando VITE_USE_MOCK no es "true" y el endpoint /healthz responde con éxito en menos de 2000ms, createAdapter devuelve HttpApiClient y delega las operaciones REST al backend.
STORAGE-ADAPTER-002 WHEN VITE_USE_MOCK is not "true" and GET /healthz responds with HTTP 200 within 2000ms THEN createAdapter shall return an instance of HttpApiClient that executes getNotes, createNote, and toggleNote over REST.

// Cuando VITE_USE_MOCK no es "true" pero la petición a /healthz falla o supera los 2000ms, createAdapter selecciona LocalStorageApiClient como respaldo.
STORAGE-ADAPTER-003 WHEN the GET /healthz request fails or times out after 2000ms THEN createAdapter shall fall back to returning an instance of LocalStorageApiClient.

// Cuando LocalStorageApiClient crea una nota, genera un identificador único, asigna el estado PENDING y la fecha ISO actual, y la guarda en localStorage bajo la clave "studynotes_v1".
STORAGE-ADAPTER-004 WHEN LocalStorageApiClient.createNote is called with a title THEN it shall create a note with status PENDING and persist it in localStorage under key "studynotes_v1".

// Cuando LocalStorageApiClient obtiene las notas desde localStorage, devuelve el arreglo ordenado por fecha de creación descendente.
STORAGE-ADAPTER-005 WHEN LocalStorageApiClient.getNotes is called THEN it shall return the stored notes sorted by createdAt descending.

// Cuando LocalStorageApiClient alterna el estado de una nota existente, invierte su estado entre PENDING y COMPLETED y persiste el cambio en localStorage.
STORAGE-ADAPTER-006 WHEN LocalStorageApiClient.toggleNote is called with an existing note ID THEN it shall flip the note status between PENDING and COMPLETED and persist the updated list in localStorage.
